WEBVTT

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:02.890
The winner... Aichi Sendou!

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:07.440
The teams advancing to the final 
round have been decided at last!

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:12.350
Team AL4 and Team Q4! These 
teams will clash tomorrow!

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:14.670
Well, well...

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:18.130
You didn't use the precious power...

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:20.280
It seems that I miscalculated.

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:37.040
The time for final judgment has come.

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:46.920
Let's all do our best in 
the final round tomorrow!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:47.540
Right!

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:48.050
Yeah.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:52.260
Without using that power, to the end...

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:56.170
I never imagined Alfred 
Early would show up then!

00:00:56.170 --> 00:00:58.200
Yeah, I was surprised, too!

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:51.550
It all began here.

00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:53.270
Watch Your Head

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:54.890
Together, we can conquer the whole country.

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:55.940
Kashiwagi Construction

00:02:54.890 --> 00:02:57.710
Together, we can soar 
to even greater heights!

00:02:58.700 --> 00:02:59.680
I refuse.

00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:02.760
Get your deck out, Ren!

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:03.680
Kai...

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:06.050
I challenge you to a fight!

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:12.200
What do you think of my image?

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:14.690
This is an image?!

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:18.370
Enfold everything in midnight 
with your sword of darkness...

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:21.270
...my avatar, Blaster Dark!

00:03:31.090 --> 00:03:31.940
Ren!

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:38.220
Kai... I got stronger, didn't I?

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:41.220
You're leaving.

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:43.310
And you're staying, huh?

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:46.730
I can't desert Ren.

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:48.600
I see...

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:08.710
I couldn't stop Ren,

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:10.480
possessed as he was by that power.

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:15.580
I was mad at myself for not being able to do 
anything, except watch him change before my eyes.

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:17.580
So I distanced myself from him.

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:20.150
I chose to run away.

00:04:20.930 --> 00:04:23.930
But I'm not the same person I was then.

00:04:25.190 --> 00:04:26.930
Remember, Aichi...

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:29.130
Remember the fight you really wanted to have!

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:33.680
The fight I really wanted to have...

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:43.500
Aichi was about to fall to 
the dark side of that power,

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:46.370
but I was strong enough to bring him back.

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:48.110
So now...

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:52.960
...this time for sure...

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:57.940
Fateful Showdown

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:06.620
Tetsu...

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:44.140
So you finally came?

00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:48.420
I knew you would come, Kai.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:50.680
Do you know why I came, too?

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:53.880
Yes. To make me surrender, right?

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:56.190
Like you did with Aichi Sendou...

00:06:00.740 --> 00:06:02.370
I feel sorry for him.

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:05.550
Thanks to the weird ideas 
you put in his head,

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:10.130
Aichi Sendou has chosen not to use his power.

00:06:10.130 --> 00:06:14.120
It's foolish to turn away 
a power such as this.

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:15.860
Kai...

00:06:16.410 --> 00:06:18.670
You don't understand...

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:20.720
how wonderful this power is.

00:06:21.220 --> 00:06:23.320
That power changed you.

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:28.610
Relying on it too much has made you forget 
how much fun Vanguard is supposed to be.

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:32.740
All you focus on is taking 
down your opponent.

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:35.520
Have you forgotten...

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:38.590
the times the three of us had, 
competing with each other?

00:06:39.910 --> 00:06:41.130
Forgotten?

00:06:42.520 --> 00:06:44.990
No matter how much I try, I can't forget.

00:06:45.660 --> 00:06:47.940
They really were good times, weren't they?

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:51.980
But, Kai, the one who ruined it

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:53.210
was you.

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:57.420
Don't tell me that you've forgotten.

00:06:58.240 --> 00:07:00.420
You abandoned me...

00:07:01.110 --> 00:07:03.850
...in retaliation for losing to me that day.

00:07:05.630 --> 00:07:07.710
When we formed Team Foo Fighter,

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:13.290
we were far from being strong enough 
to compete in the national tournament.

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:19.090
But I was satisfied with that, as long 
as the three of us could be together.

00:07:21.350 --> 00:07:22.380
However...

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:25.450
You tried to get stronger 
than anyone else, Kai.

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:30.120
I wanted to meet that passion with my own.

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:35.240
I wanted to become strong.

00:07:35.560 --> 00:07:37.980
For you, Kai, and Tetsu... For the team...

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:41.780
If I could get strong, the three of 
us could fight side-by-side forever...

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:43.870
We could even go to the 
national tournament...

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:47.930
Yes. I wanted to get strong for all of us.

00:07:48.550 --> 00:07:51.640
It was all I thought about...

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:55.450
I have to get strong!

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:03.650
I have to get strong!

00:08:04.870 --> 00:08:06.640
I have to get strong!

00:08:07.510 --> 00:08:10.440
I have to get strong... I <i>must</i>!

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:28.750
I hear the voice of the cards!

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:35.770
It felt like a secret treasure 
chest inside me had been opened.

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:39.630
I could hear the voice of the cards...

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:44.470
And so, in my next fight, they 
told me which cards to use.

00:08:44.820 --> 00:08:46.940
All I had to do was obey the voice.

00:08:47.660 --> 00:08:49.940
If I did that, I would win every time.

00:08:50.930 --> 00:08:53.310
I obtained power...

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:55.240
I became strong...

00:08:57.150 --> 00:08:59.520
I was thrilled.

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:03.930
And I was sure that you and 
Tetsu would be pleased, too.

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:11.430
Tetsu was afraid of my power, 
but he tried to accept it.

00:09:12.620 --> 00:09:16.490
You, though, Kai... you rejected me.

00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:20.200
I gained this power for the three 
of us, but you didn't accept it.

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:23.110
No. That's not all.

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:24.970
You deserted me!

00:09:46.530 --> 00:09:48.320
I won't forgive you for this!

00:09:48.820 --> 00:09:51.150
Kai!!

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:59.520
I hated you then.

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:02.760
I hated you from the bottom of my 
heart for disdaining this power

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:04.470
that I gained for the three of us.

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:11.900
I had to prove how grand and 
wonderful this power was.

00:10:12.820 --> 00:10:16.640
So that even a fool like 
you could understand...

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:31.780
Kai, this power that you wouldn't accept 
has attracted many other players,

00:10:31.780 --> 00:10:34.850
and now there are over 500 
members of Foo Fighter in all.

00:10:38.230 --> 00:10:40.340
This power is wondrous.

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:45.150
The more I use it, the more it sharpens 
my skills, flowing through my entire body.

00:10:45.820 --> 00:10:49.360
It's so powerful that it made winning at 
the national tournament, the original goal,

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:51.710
feel like a simple attainment.

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:55.480
Kai... I'm grateful to you.

00:10:56.540 --> 00:11:00.050
My hatred of you made this power stronger.

00:11:00.690 --> 00:11:03.980
It took me to heights I 
never thought possible.

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:08.440
Winning at the national 
tournament... Foo Fighter...

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:12.190
There's nothing that I can't achieve.

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:15.650
And now my interest lies in... yes...

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:19.040
Perhaps I'll use this power 
to take over the world.

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:23.060
Let's fight, Ren.

00:11:25.510 --> 00:11:27.640
I'm going to beat you, and that power,

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:30.680
and bring back the person you used to be.

00:11:30.680 --> 00:11:32.200
I swear by this!

00:11:33.760 --> 00:11:35.360
Bring me back?

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:37.200
Impossible.

00:11:37.830 --> 00:11:43.030
You see, this is the real me, the 
me that I always longed to be.

00:11:44.060 --> 00:11:47.230
I don't know what you've got up your sleeve,

00:11:47.230 --> 00:11:51.010
but if you're going to get in my 
way, I'll bring you to your knees.

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:54.870
With this power that you refuse to accept!

00:11:58.170 --> 00:11:58.970
Ren...

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:13.000
Tetsu...

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:13.680
Yes?

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:15.550
I don't need this.

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:22.580
I don't really get that machine, 
so just the gloves are fine.

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:23.620
Right, Kai?

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:27.710
Are they already at the point where fighting 
is the only way to resolve things?

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:33.620
We're going to watch this fight, too.

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:40.410
What's the meaning of this, Ren?

00:12:40.950 --> 00:12:42.450
You don't mind, do you?

00:12:43.090 --> 00:12:47.700
Unless you don't want women to see you lose?

00:12:53.780 --> 00:12:55.190
So you came...

00:12:58.020 --> 00:13:00.520
Kai? Ren?

00:13:00.970 --> 00:13:02.020
Aichi!

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:03.350
Huh.

00:13:03.730 --> 00:13:07.580
U-Um, Kourin told me to come over.

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:11.070
He has a right to watch this.

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:14.100
Interesting.

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:17.340
Now everyone who has a connection 
to the power is here.

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:20.630
No better stage could have been set.

00:13:21.620 --> 00:13:23.980
Aichi, watch our fight.

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:25.800
Watch it closely!

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:27.980
You two are fighting?

00:13:31.260 --> 00:13:32.850
Why are those two...?

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:38.750
I was looking for the strength to beat 
Ren, and the answer I arrived at is...

00:13:39.930 --> 00:13:44.050
Apparently, the power I have 
is called "Psyqualia"...

00:13:44.350 --> 00:13:46.600
Yeah. I know.

00:13:47.310 --> 00:13:49.250
Then I don't need to explain.

00:13:49.250 --> 00:13:50.890
I'll just show you...

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:53.580
...this magnificent power!

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:04.190
Wow!

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:07.460
This is Ren's...

00:14:07.460 --> 00:14:08.870
Psyqualia.

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:20.490
I saw...

00:14:20.490 --> 00:14:22.500
my victory!

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:24.940
That's right. This unit...

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:31.800
I'm going to crush that power!

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:34.510
It's no use, Kai.

00:14:34.510 --> 00:14:36.360
Even you will grovel

00:14:36.360 --> 00:14:39.390
before this power, Psyqualia.

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:54.540
Stand up the Vanguard!

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:10.520
Draw.

00:15:11.570 --> 00:15:12.810
I ride Bahr.

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:16.220
Turn end.

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:17.860
Draw.

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:21.570
I ride Blaster Javelin.

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:25.900
Call.

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:28.350
And attack...

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:36.350
I attack with Blaster Javelin!

00:15:43.310 --> 00:15:46.110
I ride Dragon Knight, Nehalem!

00:15:49.100 --> 00:15:52.660
I call Burning Horn Dragon 
and Flame of Hope, Aermo.

00:15:54.990 --> 00:15:59.660
With a boost from Conroe, 
Burning Horn attacks Gururubau!

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:11.140
With a boost from Aermo, Nehalem attacks!

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:17.230
Check the drive trigger.

00:16:21.010 --> 00:16:22.150
Check...

00:16:22.640 --> 00:16:25.010
Got a draw trigger.

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:27.860
I add +5000 to the power of Blaster Javelin.

00:16:27.860 --> 00:16:29.230
And then I draw.

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:38.380
I never thought the day would come when 
the three of us would gather here again.

00:16:39.150 --> 00:16:41.160
But everything has changed.

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:44.450
Kai, you have zero chance of winning.

00:16:44.450 --> 00:16:48.450
You can't even imagine 
how powerful Ren is now.

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:50.690
Ride!

00:16:50.950 --> 00:16:52.650
Blaster Dark!

00:16:55.140 --> 00:16:56.030
Call.

00:17:00.320 --> 00:17:01.830
Counterblast.

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:05.920
I attack with DonnerSchlag.

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:07.110
I guard with Bahr!

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:09.660
I attack with Blaster Dark!

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:11.580
No guard.

00:17:13.680 --> 00:17:16.110
Got a critical trigger.

00:17:20.040 --> 00:17:21.530
Got a heal trigger.

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:23.940
I give the power to Nehalem

00:17:23.940 --> 00:17:25.790
and heal 1 point of damage.

00:17:26.140 --> 00:17:30.450
You're afraid of this power 
because you don't have it.

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:36.600
Since you're afraid of the unknown, 
you're going to lose this time, too.

00:17:37.540 --> 00:17:39.660
And then you'll run away.

00:17:40.970 --> 00:17:42.380
I'm not going to run.

00:17:43.070 --> 00:17:44.610
I'm done running!

00:17:46.380 --> 00:17:47.330
Kai...

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:50.080
I ride...

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:53.480
...Dragonic Overlord!

00:17:55.360 --> 00:17:57.160
I call Berserk Dragon!

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:00.930
Counterblast.

00:18:02.270 --> 00:18:03.150
Charon!

00:18:05.540 --> 00:18:08.040
I attack Nemain with Berserk Dragon!

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:16.290
With a boost from Aermo...

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:18.850
...Overlord attacks!

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:24.570
No guard.

00:18:25.430 --> 00:18:27.060
Check the drive trigger.

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:33.350
Got a critical trigger.

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:36.640
I give the extra critical to Overlord...

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:39.990
...and add +5000 to the 
power of Burning Horn!

00:18:48.280 --> 00:18:49.720
Aermo's skill!

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:55.120
With a boost from Conroe...

00:18:55.840 --> 00:18:57.720
...Burning Horn attacks!

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:01.290
Burning Horn's skill!

00:19:01.730 --> 00:19:04.570
When the Vanguard has "Overlord" in its name,

00:19:04.570 --> 00:19:06.350
this unit receives +3000 power!

00:19:16.780 --> 00:19:18.610
Got a heal trigger.

00:19:19.160 --> 00:19:23.300
I give the power to Blaster Dark 
and heal 1 point of damage.

00:19:23.870 --> 00:19:25.180
This is sad...

00:19:25.940 --> 00:19:28.490
Fighting is the only way 
they can talk to each other.

00:19:28.490 --> 00:19:30.770
But I'm also envious.

00:19:31.750 --> 00:19:32.930
Suiko...

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:36.050
Stand and draw.

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:38.890
I've only gotten started, Kai.

00:19:41.270 --> 00:19:42.310
I ride...

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:44.860
Phantom Blaster Dragon!

00:19:54.340 --> 00:19:55.260
I call...

00:19:59.230 --> 00:20:01.560
DonnerSchlag's attack!

00:20:01.560 --> 00:20:02.770
I guard with Kimnara!

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:05.420
With a boost from Apocalypse,

00:20:05.420 --> 00:20:08.110
Phantom Blaster Dragon attacks!

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:11.170
Apocalypse's Soulblast.

00:20:11.630 --> 00:20:14.720
When this unit boosts a card 
with "Blaster" in its name,

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:17.450
the boosted unit receives +6000 power.

00:20:20.810 --> 00:20:21.880
No guard.

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:24.320
Check the drive trigger.

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:29.570
Got a draw trigger.

00:20:29.570 --> 00:20:31.720
I give the power to Fatalita.

00:20:32.150 --> 00:20:33.670
And then I draw.

00:20:36.690 --> 00:20:38.840
Got a draw trigger.

00:20:39.070 --> 00:20:40.940
I give the power to Overlord.

00:20:50.610 --> 00:20:52.240
With a boost from Charon,

00:20:52.240 --> 00:20:53.800
Fatalita attacks!

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:55.670
I guard with Tahr!

00:20:55.670 --> 00:20:59.520
Wow. I can feel their intensity from here...

00:21:01.170 --> 00:21:06.260
Even if you've forgotten how much fun 
Vanguard really is because you're hooked on power,

00:21:06.260 --> 00:21:07.860
I believe.

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:12.180
I have faith that the old 
Ren is still buried inside.

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:14.040
Stupid...

00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:17.800
That person is gone for good.

00:21:17.800 --> 00:21:23.280
What's here is a Vanguard fighter made 
omnipotent by the power of Psyqualia...

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:26.000
Ren Suzugamori!

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:27.730
This is the one!

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:33.250
This is the trump card 
that's going to beat you!

00:21:36.250 --> 00:21:40.600
At the end of an endless quest, 
you arrive at final evolution!

00:21:40.600 --> 00:21:45.420
Sublimate your savage soul 
and show your true form!

00:21:45.420 --> 00:21:46.840
Crossride!

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:51.530
Dragonic Overlord The End!

00:21:56.590 --> 00:21:58.930
On top of Dragonic Overlord?

00:22:07.530 --> 00:22:11.400
This is Dragonic Overlord's final form...

00:22:11.400 --> 00:22:12.800
Its true form!

00:22:13.770 --> 00:22:17.430
Ren, I'm gonna bring you back with this!

00:23:51.020 --> 00:23:51.980
"Crossride"?

00:23:52.630 --> 00:23:55.500
I guess there are still things 
I don't know about Vanguard.

00:23:55.790 --> 00:23:59.040
Aichi, watch my fight closely!

00:23:59.040 --> 00:24:01.920
And you, Ren... get your old self back!

00:24:01.920 --> 00:24:03.510
No, no, no...

00:24:03.510 --> 00:24:07.930
The same power that Aichi gave in to 
is going to make you fall into despair.

00:24:07.930 --> 00:24:10.630
Psyqualia is the power to foresee everything.

00:24:10.860 --> 00:24:12.310
Will Kai be able to win?

00:24:12.720 --> 00:24:15.360
Next time: Clash! Overlord

00:24:15.670 --> 00:24:19.420
I don't know why, but I have no image 
of the winner at the end of the fight!
